+*   **Method 2 (L2-optimal):** Complexity $Op_2 \approx k_3 2^{-3j} M^3 + k_7 N^2$ [S1, unofficial]. The term dependent on $M$ decays as $2^{-3j}$ (or $8^{-j}$) per scale [S1, unofficial].
